<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-FREE STATE 320-7, INDIA 56-1 - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-FREE STATE 320-7, INDIA 56-1 - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>BLOEMFONTEIN 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 56 for one in reply to Free State's 320 for seven at the close of the first day of their three-day match on Saturday.</p>
</text>
